<hr />
<h2 id="granular-rules-object-syntax">Granular Rules (Object Syntax)</h2>
<p>For most permissions, you can use an object to apply different actions based on the tool input.</p>
<pre><code class="language-json">{
  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://opencode.ai/config.json&quot;,
